@startuml
title Customer Candidate Workflow

state "Supplied by Jobstream" as SuppliedByJobstream
state "Approved for Contact" as ApprovedForContact
state "Contact Attempted" as ContactAttempted
state "Contacted" as Contacted
state "Interview Scheduled" as InterviewScheduled
state "Waiting for Internal Approval" as WaitingForInternalApproval
state "Approved" as Approved
state "Offer Made" as OfferMade
state "Hired or Signed" as HiredOrSigned
state "Rejected" as Rejected

[*] --> SuppliedByJobstream : CandidateSupplied

SuppliedByJobstream --> ApprovedForContact : TransferConfirmed\nvia State Engine
ApprovedForContact --> ContactAttempted : NoResponseOutcomeLogged
ApprovedForContact --> Contacted : ResponseOutcomeLogged
ContactAttempted --> ContactAttempted : NoResponseOutcomeLogged
ContactAttempted --> Contacted : ResponseOutcomeLogged
Contacted --> InterviewScheduled : ScheduleInterviewAndRequestConfirmation
Contacted --> WaitingForInternalApproval : InternalApprovalRequested
InterviewScheduled --> InterviewScheduled : FollowUpInterviewScheduled
InterviewScheduled --> InterviewScheduled : TrialDayScheduled
InterviewScheduled --> InterviewScheduled : InterviewDidNotHappen
InterviewScheduled --> OfferMade : OfferRecorded
WaitingForInternalApproval --> Approved : CustomerApproved
Approved --> OfferMade : OfferRecorded
OfferMade --> HiredOrSigned : HireOrSignRecorded

SuppliedByJobstream --> Rejected : RejectCandidate\n[rejection reason provided]
ApprovedForContact --> Rejected : RejectCandidate\n[rejection reason provided]
ContactAttempted --> Rejected : RejectCandidate\n[rejection reason provided]
Contacted --> Rejected : RejectCandidate\n[rejection reason provided]
InterviewScheduled --> Rejected : RejectCandidate\n[rejection reason provided]
InterviewScheduled --> Rejected : CandidateWithdrew
WaitingForInternalApproval --> Rejected : RejectCandidate\n[rejection reason provided]
Approved --> Rejected : RejectCandidate\n[rejection reason provided]\nTODO: confirm if allowed
OfferMade --> Rejected : RejectCandidate\n[rejection reason provided]\nTODO: confirm if allowed

HiredOrSigned --> [*]
Rejected --> [*]

note right of SuppliedByJobstream
ASSUMPTION: This is the customer-side
dynamic object lifecycle, separate from the
older HubSpot candidate/source lifecycle.
end note

note right of ApprovedForContact
Contact details become available only after
the transfer workflow records confirmation.
end note

note right of InterviewScheduled
The interview remains scheduled when the
email request is unavailable or fails.
Email retry follows CandidateInterviewEmailWorkflow
and does not repeat this transition.
end note

note left of Contacted
The queue's five visible phases are a presentation
projection over these canonical lifecycle states.
Click and drag actions both invoke the same validated
transition command; a drop never bypasses required details.
end note

note bottom
TODO: Confirm final stage labels, transition matrix,
backward/reopen behavior, and whether "Approved"
is a durable stage or an action outcome.
end note

@enduml
